    "body": "I can reproduce on this system\r\n\r\n```\r\n- Starship version: 0.47.0\r\n- zsh version: zsh 5.8 (x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu)\r\n- Operating system: Fedora 32.0.0\r\n- Terminal emulator: Gnome Terminal\r\n```\r\nusing this minimal .zshrc\r\n```shell\r\nbindkey -v\r\n\r\nautoload -Uz promptinit\r\npromptinit\r\neval $(starship init zsh)\r\n```\r\n\r\nEDIT: it's much rarer w/o zsh-syntax-highlighting",
