    "body": "@hexcowboy Huh, it really is that simple.\r\n\r\nTo add a little to this observation, there's a short delay between pressing `Esc` and when the normal-mode prompt draws. It seems that if you switch back to insert mode in that window, a line will usually be eaten up (I say 'usually' because there's a very tiny window right before the prompt redraws into normal mode where this doesn't happen).",
